### 3. Tests — `services/api/internal/$2/handlers_test.<ext>`

Required test cases:
- Happy path (valid input → correct response + status code)
- Validation error (bad input → 400)
- Auth error (missing/invalid credential → 401)
- Permission error (insufficient role → 403)
- Not found (invalid ID → 404)
- Server error (dependency failure → 500)

